Note on bundled data: the SIC code descriptions in
src/uk_company_check/sic_data.py come from the official UK SIC 2007
condensed list published by Companies House and contain public sector
information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0
(http://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/versionen3/).
The MIT licence above covers this project's own code only.